The autonomy-unlock roadmap and the commercial and product roadmaps are mostly not started.

**Completion roadmap.** 4 of 46 checkboxes are ticked (4 of 41 milestone exit criteria, plus 5 unticked M6.1 sub-items). Checking the code instead of the ticks: 6 of the 41 criteria are met, 10 are partly built and 25 are open. The doc understates M1.3, M1.4 and M2: their behaviours are in AutonomyAdversarialCampaignTests and CertifiedBrickHotSwapAutonomyTests, inside cert-gate. It overstates nothing that is ticked. M3 to M6 have not started: the Ashlar.Forge repo exists but is empty, there is no public ledger repo, no Cursor adapter and no launch. M7 has a design doc and no code.

