- the 3a pipeline is built (#665) and produces rows in CI, but no 3a row has landed in the ledger; the last landed row is dated 2026-09-25;
- 3b (operator custody) is not done;
- criterion 4 (a real hygiene PR through the loop) is not done.

**Product fleet.** Phase 0 is built, but the usage and org stores are in-memory only. Phases 1 and 2 are "Started", mostly as documents. Phases 3 to 5 have not started: no Stripe, no SSO, no /v1 API, no outbound webhooks.

**Epics.** #539 and #540 are open: share and mesh work in the e2e loop, but no dated dogfood row covers them, and the three manual mesh-lab workflows end red. #541 (GUI) has not started: no csproj references a UI framework.

Several records are stale against the code. The list is in stale_or_conflicting_docs.

